  "body": "Set well back from the road, this beautifully presented contemporary home offers exceptional space, privacy and effortless family living.\r\nFeaturing five generous bedrooms, three well-appointed bathrooms, and two separate living areas, there is ample space for families of all sizes to relax, entertain and grow.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home lies the contemporary kitchen, dining and living area - a welcoming hub perfect for everyday living and effortless entertaining. French doors open seamlessly to a large timber deck and landscaped gardens, beautifully framed by native bush, creating a tranquil setting for outdoor living.\r\n\r\nPracticality is equally well catered for, with a double internal access garage, abundant storage throughout, and off-street parking providing room for guests, additional vehicles or even the boat.\r\n\r\nA superb combination of space, functionality and privacy in a peaceful natural setting.",
